# These exclusions take precedence even inside an allowed source directory.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.log
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/credentials*
**/secrets*
